SUMMARY:Fit4Mom Yoga Night
DESCRIPTION:Yoga & Wine at Great Bear Vineyards in Davis Second Wednesday of Every Month August 12 | 6–8 PM\nTicket Includes: Yoga Class & Your First Glass of Wine\nUnroll your mat\, take a deep breath\, and enjoy an evening of movement\, mindfulness\, and wine at Great Bear Vineyards!\nJoin Fit4Mom Davis-Woodland for an easy-to-moderate Vinyasa Flow class set in the peaceful surroundings of the vineyard. This welcoming class is designed for all experience levels\, with instructors offering modifications to suit your individual practice. Flow through gentle poses\, reconnect with your breath\, and finish with an inspiring guided meditation that will leave you feeling refreshed and recharged.\nAfter class\, it’s time to reward yourself! Your ticket includes a glass of Great Bear wine\, so you can relax with friends\, wander through the vineyard\, spread out a picnic\, or simply soak in a beautiful summer evening.\nWhat to Bring Yoga mat Water bottle Towel A light jacket or sweater for the evening Money or card if you’d like to purchase an additional glass or bottle of wine Picnic food if you’d like to stay and enjoy dinner at the vineyard\nWhether you’re looking to unwind after work\, meet new friends\, or simply enjoy a little self-care in a beautiful setting\, Yoga & Wine is the perfect midweek escape.\nWe can’t wait to welcome you to the vineyard for an evening of movement\, relaxation\, and great wine!\nHosted by FIT4MOM Davis-Woodland
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/fit4mom-yoga-night-2/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards\, Great Bear Vineyards 24800 Co Rd 101A\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/Great-Bear-Vineyards_23GBV-drone-scaled-zK0eUQ.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
