UID:10003009-1786726800-1786739400@visitdavis.org
SUMMARY:Live Music and Food Truck
DESCRIPTION:Live Music & Food Truck Night in Davis  Friday\, August 14 | 5–8:30 PM\nTicket Includes: Glass of Wine & Live Music\nStart your weekend the Great Bear way with an evening of live music\, delicious wood-fired pizza\, and award-winning wine!\nGather your friends\, grab a glass of your favorite estate-grown wine\, and settle in for a relaxing summer evening surrounded by beautiful vineyard views. Italian Brother’s Pizza will be serving authentic wood-fired pizzas from 5–8:30 PM\, while Carl Winter takes the stage from 6–7:30 PM with an energetic mix of classic hits.\n Music by Carl Winter\nA true “one-man band\,” Carl Winter delivers the sound of a full band using two synthesizers\, guitar\, and vocals to perform your favorite rock and pop hits from the ’60s through the ’90s. A longtime Northern California musician and member of the popular tribute band Keep On Truckin’\, Carl’s lively performances are guaranteed to have you singing along.\n Food by Italian Brother’s Pizza\nNothing pairs better with a glass of wine than authentic wood-fired pizza! Italian Brother’s Pizza crafts every pizza from scratch using fresh\, high-quality ingredients and bakes them to perfection in a traditional wood-fired oven. From classic favorites to specialty creations\, there’s something for everyone to enjoy.\n Your Evening Includes A glass of Great Bear estate-grown wine Live music by Carl Winter (6–7:30 PM) Fresh wood-fired pizza available for purchase (5–8:30 PM) Beautiful vineyard views and a relaxing summer atmosphere\nPlease help us support this fantastic local food truck by purchasing your dinner onsite and leaving outside food at home.\nGreat music\, incredible pizza\, award-winning wine\, and a beautiful vineyard setting—what better way to kick off your weekend? We can’t wait to see you!
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/live-music-and-food-truck-20/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards\, Great Bear Vineyards 24800 Co Rd 101A\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/Highway128PressTrip_GreatBearVineyards_2024_MaxWhittaker_12-Copy-scaled-OoIRnT.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
