UID:10003000-1786730400-1786741200@visitdavis.org
SUMMARY:2nd Friday ArtAbout at the Pence Gallery
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the Pence Gallery in Davis for our 2nd Friday ArtAbout reception on August 14\, 6-9 PM. Enjoy browsing multiple art exhibits\, complimentary wine\, an art-themed scavenger hunt\, and live music by Sammy & Lauren Leverone. Free admission! \n  \nSlice: A Juried Exhibit of Regional Art | Jul. 10 – Aug. 16 \nSlice celebrates the diversity of expression in our region with an array of sculpture\, prints\, paintings\, and photography created by 35 visual artists\, selected this year by juror Gioia Fonda. \n  \nMirabel Wigon: Earth Stars | Jul. 10 – Aug. 16 \nEarth Stars brings together the artist’s expansive new series of botanical inspired paintings. Working in oil and acrylic on canvas\, her paintings have an illustrative quality\, immersing the viewer in imaginative worlds where flora works in tandem with geometric forms. See her work take 3D form through augmented reality technology. \n  \nExhibit It! A Community Art Exhibit | Jul. 3 – Aug. 16 \nExhibit It! highlights the talent of our community’s artists. View a wide variety of art in different media\, and vote for your favorite artist for the chance to win the Public Choice Award (announced at the conclusion of the exhibit). \n  \nDavid Burkholder: Day Trip | Jul. 3 – Aug. 28 \nDay Trip showcases oil paintings along the stairway by plein air painter David Burkholder. This series explores the beauty and variety within Northern California and its close neighbors\, capturing the warm light and diverse landscapes. \n  \nScavenger Hunt: Join us for a fun\, art-themed scavenger hunt at the Pence during the 2nd Friday ArtAbout. Complete all of the clues by exploring our exhibits for the chance to win a special prize. \n  \n— \n  \nVisit the Pence and other venues in Downtown Davis for the 2nd Friday ArtAbout artwalk. We will have printed ArtAbout guides available that week. Follow the ArtAbout’s Facebook page for more information: https://www.facebook.com/davisartabout. \n  \nImages: \nChristopher Keating\, “Heirloom” \nMirabel Wigon\, “Fold-forming (Budding)” \nCharli Joerger\, “Doorway to Feeling” \nDavid Burkholder\, “The Davis Gateway”
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/2nd-friday-artabout-at-the-pence-gallery-16/
LOCATION:Pence Gallery\, 212 D Street\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/Aug-14-banner-h0T2bJ.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Pence Gallery":MAILTO:pencesocialmedia@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
