SUMMARY:Hope Café
DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate the end of summer and the start of fall with an evening designed to build connection and community in Davis. Hope Café is a little bit workshop\, a little bit party — a warm\, welcoming space where live music\, creative activities\, and guided conversations invite you to pause\, reconnet\, and feel like you belong. All you need to do is show up with a curious mind and an open heart. \nWhat to Expect: \nDoors open at 6:30 PM with live world jazz by Nick Carvajal and Jim Frink. Local vendors Jumi Shrub\, Enamora Empanadas\, and Upper Crust Baking will have snacks and drinks available. Community story sharing and playful creative exercises continue through 8:30 PM\, after which guests are encouraged to linger and connect.
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/hope-cafe/
LOCATION:International House Davis\, 10 College Park\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/Hope-Cafe-8.20.26-9.25.26-Website-KPZJ6k.png
ORGANIZER;CN="International House Davis":MAILTO:shahzana@ihousedavis.org
END:VEVENT
