SUMMARY:After 5 Live @ The Melon Ball
DESCRIPTION:Live music at The Melon Ball in Davis. \nAfter5 is a Sacramento-based modern jazz group blending R&B\, Neo Soul\, and fusion into their sound. The band plays a mix of original music and their own arrangements of both modern hits and classic tunes\, giving each song a fresh feel while keeping the groove front and center. It’s a sound built for listeners who love jazz and for anyone just looking for good music to vibe to. \n$15 General Admission\n$10 Seniors (in-store or at the door only)\n$10 Students (in-store or at the door only\, w/ID)\nDoors open @ 7:00pm\nThis is a BYOB event!
