SUMMARY:Art in Action: Flying Birds Mobile
DESCRIPTION:Pence Family Art Workshops\nLet your creativity soar with this
  art project! Start with decorative art papers and string to create your o
 wn flock of birds\, and then add simple and fun touches using washi tape\,
  feathers\, and more.\n\nArt in Action: Flying Birds Mobile\nSunday\, Sept
 ember 20\, 1-3 PM\n$5 Members\, $10 Non-Members (per person\, all material
 s included)\n\n**How it works:**\nArt in Action engages kids in art projec
 ts that are fun\, creative\, and collaborative with their family members. 
 This is a drop-in program for ages 5-12. No registration in advance is req
 uired\, but space and supplies are limited to the first 25 participants an
 d are available on a first come\, first served basis.\n\nWhen you arrive\,
  pay with cash or card at the front desk. A parent or adult caregiver is r
 equired to stay\, but only has to pay for the project for themselves if th
 ey are also doing art. Stay as long or as short as you like over the two h
 our period.\n\nBecome a Member starting at $70/year and save! If you join 
 the Pence Gallery when you attend this workshop\, you can enjoy Member pri
 cing for Art in Action\, plus receive a $5 gift certificate to our gift sh
 op as a thank you. Membership supports art for all ages and makes creative
  moments like this possible—jump in and be part of it.\n\nWe have a diff
 erent Art in Action family workshop every month. Learn more at [https://pe
 ncegallery.org/art-in-action/](https://pencegallery.org/art-in-action/).\n
 \nThis monthly program is generously sponsored by Mary Stephens DeWall & L
 es DeWall.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/art-in-action/events/315966638/
